sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Client (Mobile / Web)
    participant Filter as RequestCorrelationFilter
    participant Controller as Spring Boot REST Controller
    participant Actuator as Spring Boot Actuator
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus (Scrape Engine)

    Client->>Filter: HTTP Request (Optional: X-Request-ID)
    Note over Filter: Tự sinh UUID nếu thiếu X-Request-ID
    Filter->>Filter: Ghi vào MDC (Mapped Diagnostic Context)
    Filter->>Controller: Chuyển tiếp Request
    Controller-->>Client: HTTP Response (Kèm Header X-Request-ID)
    Note over Controller,Actuator: Ghi log cấu trúc Key-Value & Cập nhật Micrometer Metrics
    loop Định kỳ mỗi 15 giây
        Prometheus->>Actuator: GET /actuator/prometheus
        Actuator-->>Prometheus: Trả về JVM, HTTP, HikariCP Metrics (Plain text)
    end
